[00:00.00] 作曲 : Blake Slatkin/Dave/Ed Sheeran/Henry Walter/Johnny McDaid/Omer Fedi
[00:00.00][by:伤感咩吖]
[00:00.03] 制作人 : Ed Sheeran/Johnny McDaid/Omer Fedi
[00:00.06]It's a long way up from rock bottom
[00:00.06]自绝望的谷底攀登 我走了条漫漫长路
[00:05.21]There's been times I felt I could fall further
[00:05.21]也曾有过无数瞬间 我感觉会坠入更深的炼狱
[00:11.22]I have loved and lost and feared and prayed
[00:11.22]我曾深爱过 失去过 恐惧过 也祈祷过
[00:16.36]But now the day bursts wild and open
[00:16.36]但此刻白昼迸发 狂野而盛放
[00:24.88]I have cried tears at my brother's grave
[00:24.88]我曾在兄弟的墓前 潸然泪下
[00:30.06]I have shaken hands with my wife's surgeon
[00:30.06]我曾紧握我妻子主刀医生的手
[00:36.06]I spent weeks inside the darkest cage
[00:36.06]我曾在最幽暗的牢笼里 度过数周
[00:41.22]But now the day bursts wild and open
[00:41.22]但此刻白昼迸发 狂野而又盛放
[00:49.78]There's a time to cry, there's a time to fold
[00:49.78]有痛哭流涕之时 也有颓然放弃之时
[00:56.63]There's a time for holding on or to let it go
[00:56.63]有执着坚守之时 也有坦然放手之时
[01:03.50]There's a time to run to the arms of hope
[01:03.50]也有奔向希望怀抱之时
[01:10.34]And the day bursts wild and open
[01:10.34]于是白昼迸发 狂野而又盛放
[01:20.82]I was raised by the church
[01:20.82]我自教会中成长
[01:22.00]Choir boy still far from fizzling
[01:22.00]那位唱诗班男孩的声音仍未消亡
[01:23.34]Not the pop star they say they prefer
[01:23.34]并非他们口中追捧的流行巨星
[01:25.23]Kept quiet but I came to be heard
[01:25.23]曾缄默不语 但我终将声震四方
[01:26.66]Been a long time up top, but I ain't complacent
[01:26.66]身居高位已久 但我从未安于现状
[01:28.65]If I look down, I can see replacements
[01:28.65]若我俯瞰 便能看见无数的替代者
[01:30.31]Late night drive with my heartbeat racing
[01:30.31]深夜心跳仍在狂飙 而我驶在路上
[01:31.86]Gotta make dreams and chase them
[01:31.86]必须去创造梦想 然后奋力去追
[01:33.43]Taken my fair share of that ridicule
[01:33.43]我承受了应得的那份嘲弄
[01:35.23]But the words are not applicable
[01:35.23]但那些言语与我毫不相干
[01:37.21]Catalogue formidable
[01:37.21]我的作品集 令人望而生畏
[01:38.24]Me and that guy are in a different place
[01:38.24]我和那种家伙 早已身处不同层次
[01:39.75]Undefeated but that's tempting fate
[01:39.75]未尝败绩 但这本身就是在引诱命运
[01:41.45]Two of them tried it, I won both cases
[01:41.45]有那么两个家伙曾有所尝试 我赢下了两场官司
[01:43.06]Won't get back all the time they wasted
[01:43.06]却赢不回他们浪费的所有光阴
[01:44.67]I am not losing steam
[01:44.67]我绝不会后劲乏力
[01:46.00]In this world, there's no relaxing
[01:46.00]在这世界 根本没有喘息之机
[01:47.53]I've been here since migraine skanking
[01:47.53]自从那首Migraine Skank的年代 我就屹立于此
[01:49.03]Never been cool, but never been a has-been
[01:49.03]从未有多酷炫 但也从未沦为过去式
[01:50.63]I'd kip on your couch if you knew me back then
[01:50.63]要是你当时认识我 我也许会睡在你家沙发
[01:52.42]Don't tell 'em 'bout the walls you're trapped in
[01:52.42]别告诉他们 你被困于怎样的心墙
[01:54.02]Gotta keep this Usain pace
[01:54.02]必须保持着博尔特般的速度
[01:55.44]Don't ask me how I got this break
[01:55.44]别问我如何得到这天赐良机
[01:56.90]I built my own bricks through constant playing
[01:56.90]我用不间断的演出 筑起了自己的壁垒
[01:58.77]SB died, couldn't stop this pain
[01:58.77]兄弟离世 这份伤痛无法停歇
[02:00.51]I look at the dots in space
[02:00.51]我凝望着宇宙中的繁星点点
[02:02.13]I wonder if he's proud
[02:02.13]不知他是否会为我骄傲
[02:03.38]Or thinks that his best friend lost his way
[02:03.38]还是觉得他最好的朋友早已迷失了方向
[02:05.04]Keep it together for my daughters
[02:05.04]为了我的女儿们 我要振作起来
[02:06.24]Gotta come natural, I don't wanna force it
[02:06.24]一切都需顺其自然 我不想强求
[02:07.87]If it's not factual, don't support it
[02:07.87]若非事实 就别去站队附议
[02:09.43]Every year, gotta re-swim these waters
[02:09.43]年复一年 必须重新游过这片水域
[02:11.08]Draw a line
[02:11.08]划清界限
[02:11.99]For the sake of all your family and friends
[02:11.99]为了你所有的家人与挚友
[02:14.28]Draw a line
[02:14.28]划清界限
[02:15.20]So history doesn't happen again
[02:15.20]别让历史重蹈覆辙
[02:17.48]Draw a line
[02:17.48]划清界限
[02:18.40]For the day to start, the night has to end
[02:18.40]因为白昼将至 黑夜必先终结
[02:20.67]Draw a line
[02:20.67]划清界限
[02:21.60]For all of these ghosts
[02:21.60]为了所有这些纠缠的魂灵
[02:24.47]Too high to fly this plane
[02:24.47]意识早已过载 无法驾驶这架飞机
[02:26.14]Too ****ed to drive this range
[02:26.14]状态早已沉沦 无法驾驭这辆路虎
[02:27.36]Can't remember the last time I was on my own without Kev, it's kinda strange
[02:27.36]不记得上次没有Kev陪着我 是什么时候 真是奇怪
[02:30.66]Not been the same since nineteen
[02:30.66]自十九岁起 一切都在改变
[02:32.06]Now to push Ly on a swing, I gotta wear disguises
[02:32.06]现在只是在秋千上推一把Ly 我都得乔装打扮
[02:34.27]I'm up for trading life sometimes
[02:34.27]有时我真想交换人生
[02:36.04]And that may surprise them
[02:36.04]这或许会让他们惊讶
[02:37.23]Every stadium, I played it
[02:37.23]每个体育场 我都曾有登台
[02:38.94]But I would still do it for free
[02:38.94]但即便分文不取 我也心甘情愿
[02:40.24]Gotta keep standards top of the top of the tree
[02:40.24]必须让标准保持在顶峰中的顶峰
[02:42.06]Press still got problems with me
[02:42.06]媒体依然对我吹毛求疵
[02:43.72]When school starts, I might peace out
[02:43.72]等开学季到来 我也许会就此隐退
[02:45.26]Till then, I keep chasing the dream
[02:45.26]在那之前 我会继续追逐梦想
[02:46.56]I could end it, but I don't wanna reach out
[02:46.56]我本可以终结这一切 但我不愿如此
[02:48.56]'Cause he means nothing to me
[02:48.56]因为他对我来说什么 毫无意义
[02:49.65]Don't worry 'bout what I make
[02:49.65]别担心我能赚到多少
[02:51.02]Don't trip them up to win this race
[02:51.02]别为了赢得比赛就去暗算别人
[02:52.64]When your career's in a risky place
[02:52.64]当你的事业岌岌可危
[02:54.26]Everything seems like a big mistake
[02:54.26]所有事看起来都像一个天大的错误
[02:55.82]I'm still looking for shit to say
[02:55.82]我仍在寻找着值得一说的东西
[02:57.38]Deluding myself that they still relate
[02:57.38]欺骗自己说他们仍然能够感同身受
[02:59.31]Depression, I keep at bay
[02:59.31]至于抑郁 我一直将它拒之门外
[03:00.57]Tomorrow's a different day
[03:00.57]明天又是崭新的一天
[03:01.83]Me and that guy don't speak no more
[03:01.83]我和那个家伙不再说话
[03:03.33]I know why, but he's not sure
[03:03.33]我知道为什么 但他不确定
[03:04.50]So what is the reason for?
[03:04.50]所以这究竟是图什么呢
[03:05.76]My heart's been broke so many times by loved ones that I don't even feel like talking
[03:05.76]我的心曾被挚爱之人伤过太多次 我甚至都懒得开口
[03:09.67]So heed that warning
[03:09.67]所以请听好那个警告
[03:10.88]Circle keeps getting smaller
[03:10.88]我的圈子变得越来越小
[03:12.46]All I need is Chez and my daughters and a few friends to help me
[03:12.46]我需要的只有Chez和我的女儿们 再有几个朋友帮我
[03:15.05]Draw a line
[03:15.05]划清界限
[03:16.00]For the sake of your little girls and their time
[03:16.00]为了你女儿们的童年与时光
[03:18.27]Draw a line
[03:18.27]划清界限
[03:19.22]But allow yourself some moments to cry
[03:19.22]但请允许自己有片刻的哭泣
[03:21.46]Draw a line
[03:21.46]划清界限
[03:22.42]And leave the past that hurt you behind
[03:22.42]把伤害过你的过去远远抛在身后
[03:24.66]Draw a line
[03:24.66]划清界限
[03:25.59]For all of these ghosts
[03:25.59]为了所有这些纠缠的魂灵
[03:27.86]Draw a line
[03:27.86]划清界限
[03:28.83]Be grateful that you've been where you've been
[03:28.83]为你曾抵达的风景心怀感激
[03:31.01]Draw a line
[03:31.01]划清界限
[03:31.70]And recognise the path that happened between
[03:31.70]并认清这一路走来发生的轨迹
[03:34.25]Draw a line
[03:34.25]划清界限
[03:35.23]There's future here that's yet to be seen
[03:35.23]这里还有尚未被看见的未来
[03:37.44]Draw a line
[03:37.44]划清界限
